{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Never heard of it.","note":"لم أسمع به أبدًا."},{"btype":"example","text":"I heard it from you.","note":"سمعت ذلك منك."},{"btype":"example","text":"You heard that, too.","note":"أنت أيضا سمعت هذا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri heard everything.","note":"سمع زيري كل شيء."},{"btype":"example","text":"He heard her say that.","note":"هو سمعها تقول ذلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"You heard Tom, didn't you?","note":"لقد سمعت توم، أليس كذلك؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"I've heard a lot about you.","note":"سمعت الكثير عنك."},{"btype":"example","text":"I heard something new today.","note":"سمعت اليوم شيئاً جديداً."},{"btype":"example","text":"I have never heard him say no.","note":"لم ألقَ منها رفضًا قطّ."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami must have heard something.","note":"لا بدّ من أنّ سامي سمع شيئا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni has heard of them for years.","note":"يسمع ياني عنهم منذ سنوات."},{"btype":"example","text":"What have you heard about Algeria?","note":"ماذا سمعت عن الجزائر؟"}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Never heard of it.","ar":"لم أسمع به أبدًا."},{"t":"I heard it from you.","ar":"سمعت ذلك منك."},{"t":"You heard that, too.","ar":"أنت أيضا سمعت هذا."},{"t":"Ziri heard everything.","ar":"سم